# Keep every text file's line endings as LF, on every system.
# Some checks compare files byte for byte or by hash (the Splunk and Sentinel queries in sigma/queries, the generated
# documents, replay/manifest.yml). Without this file, Git on Windows turns LF into CRLF when the project is cloned
# and those checks report edits that nobody made.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.zip binary
*.png binary
